  "description": "SharpProj wraps PROJ for .Net. At runtime usually a 'proj.db' package is required,\n    such as provided by the SharpProj.Database nuget package. The version number consists of the PROJ version\n    and the wrapping. As Such SharpProj 8.2001.3 is based on PROJ 8.2.1 and is SharpProj build 3 for\n    this version.\n    Please use the SharpProj nuget package unless you explicitly want to ignore the database.",
